From: tanjilbhuiyan <tanjilbhuiyan@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:11:46 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: configs: a50_firstlight: boot all CPUs

All 8 CPUs come up on 6.18 through PSCI (M4.1).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Ie3b1544a9ef58190e5a761f1a66dacc26929e23b
---
 arch/arm64/configs/a50_firstlight_defconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/a50_firstlight_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/a50_firstlight_defconfig
index 3f4aeb076..5cef68696 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/a50_firstlight_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/a50_firstlight_defconfig
@@ -57,7 +57,7 @@ CONFIG_ARCH_EXYNOS=y
 # CONFIG_ARM64_POE is not set
 # CONFIG_ARM64_GCS is not set
 # CONFIG_ARM64_SVE is not set
-CONFIG_CMDLINE="console=tty0 loglevel=7 ignore_loglevel maxcpus=1"
+CONFIG_CMDLINE="console=tty0 loglevel=7 ignore_loglevel"
 CONFIG_CMDLINE_EXTEND=y
 # CONFIG_EFI is not set
 # CONFIG_SUSPEND is not set
-- 
